    {
      "uid": "zhcn:222decf833e3fbc3f9a64783",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜晚的户外相当寒冷。\r\n我们的吐息纷纷化作片片白雾，\r\n在刹那间闪烁着群星的光芒——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca02b9de685ab1ea8b651096ce94eca87123aedc1fdebf7403d0a9663b2d0d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033112.json",
      "json_path": [
