    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3150685110a782b9c8414f1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看上去，仿佛是宇宙中的星云。\r\n无数小小的宇宙随我们的呼吸而诞生、湮灭……\r\n这时，爱慕织姬低声开口了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb766044a3cdcb0e32f2d1cbc93760a29e66efc0010c72e1f857f2642a74aa23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
